WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:04.200
Morticia and Gomez are one of the&nbsp;
spookiest couples in pop culture&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.738
history — so why are fans up in arms&nbsp;
about their portrayal in Wednesday?

00:00:07.738 --> 00:00:12.600
Tim Burton's Wednesday has finally arrived on&nbsp;
Netflix, and in a snap (or two for the fans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:16.920
out there), it has been snatched up by eager&nbsp;
audiences who have binged through this new&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:22.320
take on the Addams Family's dark-minded daughter.&nbsp;
In particular, fans have praised Jenna Ortega's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:26.100
performance as Wednesday Addams. In the new&nbsp;
series, Wednesday takes center stage after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:30.660
being enrolled in Nevermore Academy, where she&nbsp;
begins investigating a series of brutal murders.

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:35.280
Obviously, it wasn't exactly what you'd call a&nbsp;
shocking revelation to see Wednesday getting the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:39.900
most attention out of the Addams family we know,&nbsp;
love, and fear — the show is named after her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:44.160
after all. Still, would it really be&nbsp;
an Addams-adjacent project if the other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:47.400
members of the titular family didn't&nbsp;
make an appearance? For some, though,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:51.240
therein lies the problem. Now that viewers have&nbsp;
finished with the first season of Wednesday,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:55.382
it seems that some are taking issue with&nbsp;
the heads of the Addams family household.

00:00:55.782 --> 00:00:58.064
"I've always been open to constructive criticism."

00:00:58.064 --> 00:01:02.820
In the show, Morticia and Gomez are played&nbsp;
by Catherine Zeta-Jones and Luis Guzmán,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:06.120
who, while having nowhere near&nbsp;
as much screen time as Ortega,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:11.340
still had some serious shoes to fill. The roles&nbsp;
have been irrevocably bound to Anjelica Huston&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:16.860
and Raúl Juliá since they brought the characters&nbsp;
to the big screen with flawless chemistry in Barry&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:22.887
Sonnenfeld's 1991 film The Addams Family&nbsp;
and its 1993 sequel, Addams Family Values.

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:31.619
"I would die for her. I would kill&nbsp;
for her. Either way, what bliss."

00:01:31.619 --> 00:01:35.820
It may be that these rock-solid performances&nbsp;
still linger in the minds of fans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:39.420
since some viewers have claimed that&nbsp;
they fail to see even a flicker of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:42.660
a spark between Morticia and Gomez&nbsp;
in this new take on the characters.

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:48.060
If you're familiar with cartoonist Charles Addams'&nbsp;
original characters, you'll know that Morticia and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:53.340
Gomez Addams more than look the part on Wednesday,&nbsp;
with Guzmán's short stature providing a humorous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:58.800
contrast to Zeta-Jones' height. However, looks&nbsp;
aren't everything, and some fans seem to feel that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:04.200
romance is very much dead between the two — which&nbsp;
is unfortunate, since the Raul Julia and Anjelica&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:08.820
Huston incarnations of the characters are depicted&nbsp;
as such lovebirds. In the television subreddit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:12.359
one fan expressed their concerns about&nbsp;
the characters' casting. They wrote:

00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:23.051
Another Redditor agreed, saying:

00:02:31.740 --> 00:02:36.300
But if the final choices weren't up to snuff&nbsp;
for audiences, who else would fit the bill&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:39.720
for one of pop culture's maddest&nbsp;
couples? One Reddit user suggests:

00:02:48.583 --> 00:02:51.360
Still, if a second season of&nbsp;
Wednesday gets the green light,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:55.800
Zeta-Jones and Luis Guzmán might get another&nbsp;
shot to capture the passion that some believe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.800 --> 00:03:00.360
has been missing this time around. Everyone&nbsp;
is allowed to have one bad day, after all.

